## What Did NOT Work (and why)

- **Stale Next.js dev server cache.** Dev server running since 2026-05-24 held merge-conflict-marker parsing errors from yesterday's stash pop / mid-merge state. Files on disk were CLEAN; only the Turbopack cache showed phantom errors. Fix: stop server + `rm -rf webapp/.next` + restart. Console clean after restart.
- **Initial q4 framing was too narrow.** I presented 3 options excluding «Bible sub-area refs» (q16 b) and didn't surface that q4 was actually a re-asking of q16 (open since 2026-05-22 in PLAN.md). Sibling session caught this in feedback JSON. Recovered by re-presenting all q16 options + dual-pass + asking explicitly which path. Director chose q4a (status quo).
- **First questions were too tabular.** Director directly said «твой стиль нечитаемый для меня» on the comparison-table-with-rows-of-options pattern. Saved as feedback memory (`director_questions_human_style.md`), later promoted to global rule.
